{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_pinecn_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_pinecn_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "从头来过",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_pinecn_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "794662c079a9994240b8fbc831d21ac551e9cafdc1cccde3c5b07b887d75a6da",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "爱德森，抱、抱歉，我去得迟了，食堂的早餐已经没剩什么了，你将就吃一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "没关系，米娜姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "对了对了，我的简历你有帮我交吗？罗德岛工程部同意我入职吗？我是不是很快就能和你做同事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "你怎么了，你的表情看起来很奇怪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "没、没成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "米娜姐姐，你是不是没跟工程部的人说我是你的老乡啊？我是特意来投奔你的，我的履历很清白，不是什么来历不明的家伙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "我从小跟着父辈在工地上进进出出，砌筑工钢筋工测量工架子工......什么类型的活我都能干，罗德岛可以无偿测试我一段时间的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "爱德森，过两天，我们一起回哥伦比亚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "一起？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "呜......我也被开除了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "所以......松果需要离开罗德岛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "什么时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "越快越好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "没得商量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "没得商量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "可、可是，他们为什么这么对你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "你经常寄信回家，你的爸爸会把信给我们看，你每次不都说从来没想过会遇见罗德岛这样的公司吗？福利待遇好，也很有人情味......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "可罗德岛毕竟只是一家公司啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "公司有需要员工的时候，就总会有不需要员工的时候......在哥伦比亚，我们见过很多这样的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "（擦眼泪）好了，爱德森，你记得吃早餐，我要先去工作了。舰桥检修的工期很紧张，工程部今天有的忙呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "米娜姐姐，他们都这样对你了，你还要跟个没事人一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "罗德岛之前并没有亏待我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "而且，属于我的工作，必须要做完的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "再说我也想找卡夫卡问问清楚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "卡夫卡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嘿，米娜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "你怎么眼睛红红的，没睡好？打起精神来......啊，我有点事要去找酸糖，先走了先走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "你、你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "你没有什么话想跟我说吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "唔，米娜，晚一些好吗？再给我一点时间......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "其实你不用担心我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "嘿，松果，别愣在那儿了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "来了来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "你光拎着一把钉枪就过来了啊，又把工具包忘在宿舍了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "啊，对不起，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "出门的时候分神了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "这可不是第一回了哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "上周你把备用电池落在了训练场的施工区，等到训练场快要关闭的时候才发现，整艘船的人都看着你气喘吁吁地折返跑......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "一桩桩一件件，我们可都记得哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "（是因为这个......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "（米娜，谁会喜欢总丢三落四的人呢......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "好了，先用我的工具包吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "确认一下任务日志，你负责左边的区域，我负责右边，今天之内得完成对舰桥的整体检修。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "前辈，为什么这么急？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "之后，我们还需要对中层甲板、下层甲板，以及舰载天灾预警系统和开采模块等重要区域进行检修，为全舰拆分做尽可能多的准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "全、全舰拆分？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "是说整艘陆行舰都要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "就说大家最近看起来那么忙碌......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "你在想什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "前辈，我能理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "小时候爸爸跟我说，哥伦比亚每天都有无数家新公司、无数支新工程队诞生，但它们的总数其实一直都没怎么变过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "当时我不懂那些话是什么意思，后来我长大了，自己开始在一个又一个工程队之间辗转，看得多了，也就明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "大地是无情的，公司和人一样脆弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "这话怎么听着那么奇怪......算了我也解释不清楚。工程部接到指令也没多久，好好干完这最后的活吧，松果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "对了，今天下班后记得去工程部核对任务日志。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "难怪要遣散员工......罗德岛，这么好的公司......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "可是，米娜，你又能做什么呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "您好，舰桥检修完毕，我来汇总并核对这段时间的任务日志。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "啊，松果干员，稍等片刻可以吗，容我们处理完手头的工作？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "这些是全部了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员C",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "哥伦比亚烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局的审批公函，罗德岛与莱茵生命等企业在医药、能源等领域的业务合作都逐一登记在案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "最厚的这叠文件，是和雷姆必拓相关的......罗德岛以工程部和干员个人名义在雷姆必拓参与过数十次高难度开采作业。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "维多利亚的在这边......莱塔尼亚......卡西米尔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员C",
      "text": "说起来，全舰从检修到拆分，这可能是工程部有史以来最忙的时候，我们真的不去帮其他人，而是在这里整理旧文件吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "这也是同等重要的工作啊，朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员C",
      "text": "可能吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "本舰拆分之后，罗德岛在各地的办事处就要忙碌起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "这些旧文件，可不仅仅是我们去过哪些地方、做过哪些事情的纪念。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员B",
      "text": "它们是给别人看的，也是给我们自己看的......它们能向所有人证明，我们能做到什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员C",
      "text": "......也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员C",
      "text": "啊，松果干员，你的任务日志我这边已经确认了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "那个，我......能麻烦您帮个忙吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员C",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "我想调取自己入职后的全部任务记录。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "米娜姐姐，你终于回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "嗯嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "你有去找他们要个说法吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "爱德森，发生了一些事情，我、我不知道该怎么解释......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "那你怎么办，我们怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "我一直觉得你很厉害，米娜姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "你爸爸出事，家里发生了那么大的变故，你都挺过来了。我听说当年你甚至去曼斯菲尔德监狱帮助了西蒙家的大少爷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "后来你被迫离开了家乡，来到这么远的地方，可你依然找到了一份很不错的工作。可最终，你还是只能就这么回哥伦比亚吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "因为拓荒规划，咱们的镇子被迫搬得离移动城市更远了，活路本来就很难找。加上当年你爸爸和西蒙家大少爷的事情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "那些和我们打过交道的工头和老板们，指不定还要怎么使绊子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......这些我都知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "难道你真的要一个工地一个工地找过去，一个人一个人地求过去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "米娜姐姐，你有没有听我说话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "你手里拿的是什么啊？回来之后，你就一直在翻......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "我入职以来的全部任务记录。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一千三百七十二项任务记录。\n事故率：百分之零点七。\n超标准完工率：百分之四十二。\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "三年又九个月......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "原来，已经过了这么长的时间了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "原来，我已经做过这么多的事情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "爱德森，不会发生那样的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱德森",
      "text": "米娜姐姐，你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "我或许会带着你回哥伦比亚，哥伦比亚或许也还是我离开时的那副样子，但你刚刚担心的那些事情......我不会让它们发生的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "但我要先去找一个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "啊，米娜米娜，我正要去你的宿舍呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "呼~卡夫卡，我正要找你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "你听我说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "卡夫卡，我知道你是担心我，不知道该怎么开这个口。/米娜，我确实有点不好意思，不知道怎么开这个口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "我其实已经知道了。公司遣散员工，我见过很多也经历过很多。/在酸糖教我玩滑板之前，我不知道这玩意这么有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "大个子介绍我来这里时，我只是想找一份稳定的工作。/它对于街头上长大的孩子来说，就是警察的弩，上班族的咖啡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "最开始我也只能作为助手，在工程部给前辈们打打下手....../酸糖说过两天有个最高规格的滑板比赛，全泰拉的高手聚在一起炫技定榜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "罗德岛是一家很好的公司，也是一个很好的家，它改变了我很多。/毫无疑问，这种比赛将改变我这种新手的一生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "三年多过去，我还是会出门的时候忘了带工具包....../但是工程部交给咱们俩的任务确实也很紧急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "但我的职衔其实变过很多次，我早就在独立负责很多事情了。/我们要尽快赶到罗德岛驻哥伦比亚办事处......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "卡夫卡，米娜早就是一个成熟的大人，成熟的工人了！/帮助罗德岛在当地组建一支自己的工程队，以应对未来可能的情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "成熟的大人不怕离开家，成熟的工人不怕在荒野里创造活路。/我纠结了大半天，米娜，可能得辛苦你一个人先动身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "我决定回到哥伦比亚，拉起一支自己的工程队！/但我最多迟一周就赶回哥伦比亚帮你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "等到时机成熟的时候，说不定我还能回过头来帮罗德岛渡过危机！/所以这几天，你就代表了罗德岛工程部！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "我有这个能力！/你有这个能、力！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果/卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "办事处......工程队......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "等等，米娜，你是不是误会什么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "上午在中层甲板的走廊，我听见你和工程部的前辈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "之前跟你说过，接下来罗德岛会加速推进各地办事处的工作。你们来自哥伦比亚，也熟悉那股拓荒的热潮，就当出个长期外勤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "我明白啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "所以，你和松果需要离开罗德岛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "什么时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "越快越好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "没得商量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "没得商量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "滑板比赛的事情，我理解啦，我自己还是滑翔伞爱好者，我倒是也相信松果能独立处理前期的各种事情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "这样吧，你和酸糖比一场滑板，你能从她手里赢下三分，我就承认你参加接下来那场比赛的必要性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部干员A",
      "text": "以及......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "以及，我必须自己说服松果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "所以，你从酸糖姐姐手里赢下三分了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "我赢了四、分！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "真是抱歉啊，米娜，造成了这么大的误会，让你这么难过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "没、没关系。我也没有难过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "可能我是个比较笨的人吧，来罗德岛第四个年头了，除了偶尔给爸爸写信，我很少会去想自己现在是什么样子的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "安全帽、钉枪、工具包、软软的枕头......上工、吃饭、睡觉、领工资、偶尔和大家在甲板上唱歌......生活好像没有变化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "但其实，其实......我早就不一样了......啊，是很好的那种。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "说起来，认识这么久，我好像还是第一次听你一口气说这么多话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "唔，有、有吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嗯......不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "卡夫卡，今天的事，虽然说不上来怎么回事，但好像......好像结果是一样的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "我会带着爱德森先回哥伦比亚办事处报到。然后我想要回老家的镇子一趟，看看爸爸......那里说不定也会有我们需要的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "松果",
      "text": "你去跟工程部的前辈汇报吧，你说服了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "......是你说服了我，米娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
